{
    "chapter_num": 15,
    "verses_count": 58,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Risen Christ, Faith’s Reality"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover, brethren, I declare to you the gospel which I preached to you, which also you received and in which you stand, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by which also you are saved, if you hold fast that word which I preached to you—unless you believed in vain."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I delivered to you first of all that which I also received: that Christ died for our sins according to the Scriptures, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and that He was buried, and that He rose again the third day according to the Scriptures, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and that He was seen by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Peter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Cephas, then by the twelve. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After that He was seen by over five hundred brethren at once, of whom the greater part remain to the present, but some have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Died"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fallen asleep. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After that He was seen by James, then by all the apostles. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then last of all He was seen by me also, as by one born out of due time."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I am the least of the apostles, who am not worthy to be called an apostle, because I persecuted the church of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But by the grace of God I am what I am, and His grace toward me was not in vain; but I labored more abundantly than they all, yet not I, but the grace of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, whether "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I or they, so we preach and so you believed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Risen Christ, Our Hope"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now if Christ is preached that He has been raised from the dead, how do some among you say that there is no resurrection of the dead? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if there is no resurrection of the dead, then Christ is not risen. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if Christ is not risen, then our preaching "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " empty and your faith "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also empty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yes, and we are found false witnesses of God, because we have testified of God that He raised up Christ, whom He did not raise up—if in fact the dead do not rise. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " dead do not rise, then Christ is not risen. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if Christ is not risen, your faith "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " futile; you are still in your sins! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then also those who have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Died"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fallen asleep in Christ have perished. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If in this life only we have hope in Christ, we are of all men the most pitiable."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Last Enemy Destroyed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now Christ is risen from the dead, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has become the firstfruits of those who have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Died"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fallen asleep. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For since by man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " death, by Man also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the resurrection of the dead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as in Adam all die, even so in Christ all shall be made alive. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But each one in his own order: Christ the firstfruits, afterward those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Christ’s at His coming. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "comes"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the end, when He delivers the kingdom to God the Father, when He puts an end to all rule and all authority and power. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He must reign till He has put all enemies under His feet. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The last enemy "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will be destroyed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " death. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He has put all things under His feet.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " But when He says “all things are put under "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " evident that He who put all things under Him is excepted. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when all things are made subject to Him, then the Son Himself will also be subject to Him who put all things under Him, that God may be all in all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Effects of Denying the Resurrection"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Otherwise, what will they do who are baptized for the dead, if the dead do not rise at all? Why then are they baptized for the dead? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And why do we stand in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "danger"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "jeopardy every hour? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I affirm, by the boasting in you which I have in Christ Jesus our Lord, I die daily. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If, in the manner of men, I have fought with beasts at Ephesus, what advantage "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to me? If "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " dead do not rise, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Let us eat and drink, for tomorrow we die!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not be deceived: “Evil company corrupts good habits.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Awake to righteousness, and do not sin; for some do not have the knowledge of God. I speak "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to your shame."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Glorious Body"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But someone will say, “How are the dead raised up? And with what body do they come?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Foolish one, what you sow is not made alive unless it dies. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And what you sow, you do not sow that body that shall be, but mere grain—perhaps wheat or some other "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "grain."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But God gives it a body as He pleases, and to each seed its own body."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All flesh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not the same flesh, but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "kind"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit of flesh"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " flesh of men, another flesh of animals, another of fish, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " another of birds."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "heavenly"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "celestial bodies and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "earthly"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "terrestrial bodies; but the glory of the celestial "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "glory"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the terrestrial "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " another. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one glory of the sun, another glory of the moon, and another glory of the stars; for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " star differs from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "another"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " star in glory."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the resurrection of the dead. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "The body"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is sown in corruption, it is raised in incorruption. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is sown in dishonor, it is raised in glory. It is sown in weakness, it is raised in power. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is sown a natural body, it is raised a spiritual body. There is a natural body, and there is a spiritual body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“The first man Adam became a living being.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " The last Adam "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "became"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a life-giving spirit."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "However, the spiritual is not first, but the natural, and afterward the spiritual. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 47,
                    "num_str": "47",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The first man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the earth, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "made"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "earthy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of dust; the second Man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the Lord from heaven. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 48,
                    "num_str": "48",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "earthy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of dust, so also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are made"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of dust; and as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the heavenly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Man,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " so also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heavenly. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 49,
                    "num_str": "49",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as we have borne the image of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of dust, we"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M let us also bear"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " shall also bear the image of the heavenly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Man."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Our Final Victory"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 50,
                    "num_str": "50",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now this I say, brethren, that flesh and blood cannot inherit the kingdom of God; nor does corruption inherit incorruption. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 51,
                    "num_str": "51",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Behold, I tell you a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "hidden truth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "mystery: We shall not all sleep, but we shall all be changed— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 52,
                    "num_str": "52",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in a moment, in the twinkling of an eye, at the last trumpet. For the trumpet will sound, and the dead will be raised incorruptible, and we shall be changed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 53,
                    "num_str": "53",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this corruptible must put on incorruption, and this mortal "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " put on immortality. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 54,
                    "num_str": "54",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when this corruptible has put on incorruption, and this mortal has put on immortality, then shall be brought to pass the saying that is written: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Death is swallowed up in victory.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 55,
                    "num_str": "55",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“O"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU O Death, where is your victory? O Death, where is your sting?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Death, where"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "your sting?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "O Hades, where"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "your victory?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 56,
                    "num_str": "56",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sting of death "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sin, and the strength of sin "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 57,
                    "num_str": "57",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But thanks "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to God, who gives us the victory through our Lord Jesus Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 58,
                    "num_str": "58",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, my beloved brethren, be steadfast, immovable, always abounding in the work of the Lord, knowing that your labor is not in vain in the Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}